---
const siteName = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_NAME;
---

<footer class="border-t border-charcoal-900/10 dark:border-cream-100/10 mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      <!-- Brand -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <h3 class="font-serif-display text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal-900 dark:text-cream-100 mb-3">
          {siteName}
        </h3>
        <p class="text-charcoal-800/70 dark:text-cream-100/70 text-sm max-w-md leading-relaxed">
          AI 产品经理 · 用 Agent 思维解决真实问题。专注于 AI 产品设计、评测体系搭建与 Agent 应用落地。
          <span class="block mt-1 text-ochre-500/80 italic">让 AI 理解人，而不只是回答问题</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Quick Links -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-medium text-charcoal-900 dark:text-cream-100 mb-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">
          导航
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li><a href="/projects" class="text-charcoal-800/70 dark:text-cream-100/70 hover:text-ochre-500 text-sm transition-colors">项目作品</a></li>
          <li><a href="/thinking" class="text-charcoal-800/70 dark:text-cream-100/70 hover:text-ochre-500 text-sm transition-colors">思考文章</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about" class="text-charcoal-800/70 dark:text-cream-100/70 hover:text-ochre-500 text-sm transition-colors">关于我</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Contact -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-medium text-charcoal-900 dark:text-cream-100 mb-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">
          联系方式
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li>
            <a href="mailto:maravillosokk@163.com" class="text-charcoal-800/70 dark:text-cream-100/70 hover:text-ochre-500 text-sm transition-colors flex items-center">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
              </svg>
              maravillosokk@163.com
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/huang-doudou567" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-charcoal-800/70 dark:text-cream-100/70 hover:text-ochre-500 text-sm transition-colors flex items-center">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/>
              </svg>
              huang-doudou567
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Bottom -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-charcoal-900/10 dark:border-cream-100/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center">
      <p class="text-charcoal-800/50 dark:text-cream-100/50 text-xs font-mono-code">
        © 2025 {siteName}. Built with Astro + Tailwind CSS.
      </p>
      <p class="text-charcoal-800/40 dark:text-cream-100/40 text-xs mt-2 sm:mt-0">
        用 ❤️ 和 Agent 思维打造
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
